(card "exp:C20_recent_signal_flow_skip" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:C20_recent_signal_flow_skip"
  :body "---\nnav: 23\ntype: experiment\nid: C20_recent_signal_flow_skip\nshort_name: recent_signal_flow_skip\ntitle: \"C20 — recent signal flow skip (Team A top-3 reference)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: a\nround: r6\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: null\ntrain_nav: 2.2050\ntrain_trade_count: 131\ntrain_win_rate: 0.855\ntrain_sharpe: 7.9509\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0666\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0026\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.2581\ntest_trade_count: 18\ntest_sharpe: 8.2216\ntest_win_rate: 0.8333\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0038\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: test_marginal\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [microstructure, timing_filter]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/a, round/r6, axis/microstructure, axis/timing_filter, status/challenger, outcome/test_marginal, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# C20 — recent signal flow skip\n\n> **TL;DR** —— Team A C20: 在 anchor base 上加 \"recent signal flow skip\" filter — 当 trigger 时刻附近 raw signal 密度高时 skip (避免 noise 区域). train 2.20 marginal, **test 1.258 vs anchor 1.249 marginal +0.01**. 也是 Team A top-3 test 表现.\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：当 trigger 附近 signal flow 密 (e.g. 多个 noise trigger 集中爆发), trade 的 noise 大 → skip.\n- 期待: trade_count 略降, win/sharpe 升, NAV marginal.\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- `team_a/scripts/round_6_runner.py`\n- 步骤: anchor base + skip leg if past-Xs signal density > threshold.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- past signal density past-only. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.2050 | 131 | 7.95 | 85.5% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0666 ± 0.003 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.2581 | 18 | 8.22 | 83.3% | -0.38% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | +0.010 | -2 | +1.07 | +8.3pp | +0.15pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0. \n- test sharpe 8.22 / win 83% 实际优秀, NAV 接近 anchor 因 trade_count 少 2 笔.\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **Team A top picks**: [[arc_260516a__team_a__C7__same_minute_pre_amt]], [[arc_260516a__team_a__C6__anchor_plus_impact_cap]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_a/output/cross_round_leaderboard.csv` (C20)\n- `cross_team_test_nav_ranking_v2.csv` (C20 test 1.258)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- Team A 这条 \"signal flow density skip\" 是个 underexplored axis. test win 83% / sharpe 8.22 在 Team A 路线里属顶级 quality, 只是 trade_count 少.\n- 下次类似 axis 可以放宽 density threshold 让 trade_count 升, 看是否 sharpe 保持.\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_a__C20__recent_signal_flow_skip.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:31:32+08:00"
  :ingested_at "2026-05-21T01:29:42+08:00")

